## 3. Training

| Parameter       | Value         |
|-----------------|---------------|
| Optimizer       | Adam          |
| Learning rate   | 0.01          |
| Weight decay    | 1e-5          |
| Epochs          | 25            |
| Batch size      | 32            |
| Dropout         | 0.4           |
| λ (reg. weight) | 0.05          |
| ε (clip radius) | 0.15          |

### Loss Function

A **masked MSE** is used to compute prediction loss only over movies the user
has actually rated, ignoring zero-padded (unseen) entries:

```python
loss = sum((pred - target)^2 * mask) / (count_rated + 1e-8)
```

