## 10. Usage Example

```python
# Load data and build matrices
ratings_df, movies_df = load_movielens_data()

# Initialize and train model
model = SoftRegularizedHCAIAutoEncoder(num_movies, num_genres, pure_genre_matrix_np)
optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=0.01)

for epoch in range(25):
    t_loss, p_loss, s_loss = train_step(model, optimizer, batch, mask)

# Inference
model.eval()
scores, latent_profile = model(user_vector)

# Human override
overrides = build_override_tensor({"Sci-Fi": "strongly_increase"}, num_genres)
scores_overridden, _ = model(user_vector, user_overrides=overrides, alpha=3.0)

# Explanation
explanation = generate_soft_xai_explanation(title, movie_idx, model, latent_profile[0])
```
